# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:55
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kgraphviewer; is a &graphviz; &dot; graph viewer. It is developed in the "
"&kde; community. The &graphviz; programs are free-software layout engines "
"for graphs. Graphs are commonly used in scientific domains and particularly "
"in computer science."
msgstr ""
"&kgraphviewer; इति &graphviz; &dot; आलेखदर्शकः । तस्य विकासः &kde; समुदाय। "
"द &graphviz; कार्यक्रमाः आलेखानां कृते मुक्त-सॉफ्टवेयर-विन्यास-इञ्जिनाः "
"सन्ति । वैज्ञानिकक्षेत्रेषु विशेषतः सङ्गणकशास्त्रे च आलेखानां उपयोगः "
"सामान्यतया भवति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:58
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kgraphviewer; displays the graphs in a modern, user-friendly &GUI;."
msgstr "&kgraphviewer; आधुनिक, उपयोक्तृ-अनुकूल &GUI;-रूपेण आलेखान् प्रदर्शयति ।"

