# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:77
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kgraphviewer; is a &graphviz; &dot; graph viewer. The &graphviz; programs "
"are free-software layout engines for graphs. &kgraphviewer; displays the "
"graphs in a modern, user-friendly &GUI;. It has the following features:"
msgstr ""
"&kgraphviewer; इति &graphviz; &dot; आलेखदर्शकः । द &graphviz; कार्यक्रमाः "
"आलेखानां कृते मुक्त-सॉफ्टवेयर-विन्यास-इञ्जिनाः सन्ति । &kgraphviewer; "
"आधुनिक, उपयोक्तृ-अनुकूल &GUI;-रूपेण आलेखान् प्रदर्शयति । अस्य "
"निम्नलिखितविशेषताः सन्ति ।"

