#: index.docbook:131
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kgraphviewer;"
msgstr "&kgraphviewer इत्यस्य उपयोगेन;"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:134
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Main Window"
msgstr "मुख्यविण्डो इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:136
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The main window displays the loaded graphs, each in its own tab. Initially, "
"if you start &kgraphviewer; without arguments, its main window will be "
"empty as in the screenshot below. In this case, the toolbar contains only "
"the <guibutton>Open...</guibutton> and the (empty) <guibutton>Open "
"Recent</guibutton> buttons. Click on the first one to open the standard "
"<guilabel>Open File</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""
"मुख्यविण्डो लोड् कृतानि आलेखानि प्रदर्शयति, प्रत्येकं स्वस्य ट्याब् मध्ये । "
"प्रारम्भे यदि भवान् &kgraphviewer; तर्कं विना तस्य मुख्यविण्डो अधोलिखिते "
"स्क्रीनशॉट् इव रिक्तं भविष्यति । अस्मिन् सति साधनपट्टिकायां केवलं "
"<guibutton>Open...</guibutton> तथा (रिक्त) <guibutton>Open "
"Recent</guibutton> बटन् भवति । मानकं <guilabel>Open File</guilabel> संवादं "
"उद्घाटयितुं प्रथमे नुदन्तु ।"

